{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "document_id": "ch-intro-resources",
  "title": "Resources",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "FAQ",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If during the building of the LFS system you encounter any errors, have any questions, or think there is a typo in the book, please start by consulting the list of Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ), located at"
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/faq/",
              "label": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/faq/"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "ch-intro-faq"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "Mailing Lists",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "linuxfromscratch.org"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "server hosts a number of mailing lists used for the development of the LFS project. These lists include the main development and support lists, among others. If you cannot find an answer to your problem on the FAQ page, the next step would be to search the mailing lists at"
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/search.html",
              "label": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/search.html"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For information on the different lists, how to subscribe, archive locations, and additional information, visit"
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/mail.html",
              "label": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/mail.html"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "ch-intro-maillists"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "IRC",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Several members of the LFS community offer assistance via Internet Relay Chat (IRC). Before using this support, please make sure your question is not already answered in the LFS FAQ or the mailing list archives. You can find the IRC network at"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "text": "irc.libera.chat"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". The support channel is named #lfs-support."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "ch-intro-irc"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "Mirror Sites",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The LFS project has a number of world-wide mirrors to make accessing the website and downloading the required packages more convenient. Please visit the LFS website at"
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "href": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/mirrors.html",
              "label": "https://www.linuxfromscratch.org/mirrors.html"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "for a list of current mirrors."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "ch-intro-mirrors"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "title": "Contact Information",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Please direct all your questions and comments to one of the LFS mailing lists (see above)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "id": "ch-intro-contactinfo"
    }
  ]
}
